  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The keybindings you set in the VRChat Configuration window will only work while loading it this way.\n\nIf you change a keybinding and start the game it will work.\nBut if you restart the game and don't go via the VRChat Configuration window the keybinding you have set will not work.\n\nBecause I don't have a US keyboard I have to change the debug keybindings, but it will only work if I load the game via the VRChat Configuration window.\n\n\nRepo steps:\n\n- Start the game while holding shift\n- Change the keybindings for the debug keys\n- Click Play! and press the keys when it's loaded to make sure it working\n- Restart the game, but this time don't hold shift.\n- Press the same bindings",
